        "Lambert W function" to """Solves \(x e^x = a\): \(W(1) \approx 0.5671\), and \(x e^x = 2\) gives \(x = W(2)\).""",
        "Bessel function of the first kind" to """The order \(a\) goes in the small box: \(J_0(0) = 1\); graph \(y = J_0(x)\) for a damped wave.""",
        "Bessel function of the second kind" to """The order \(a\) goes in the small box: \(Y_0(1) \approx 0.0883\); it's infinite at 0.""",
        "contour integral" to """Fill the function; the circle \(|z| = 1\) is filled in, change it to any circle: \(\oint_{|z| = 1} \frac{1}{z}\,dz = 2\pi i\).""",
        "residue" to """Fill the function, then set the point underneath: \(\operatorname{Res}_{z = 0} \frac{e^z}{z^2} = 1\).""",
        "z" to """The variable of the complex plane: plot \(f(z) = z^2\) there. In the calculator it's a letter like any other.""",
        "w" to """A second complex letter, for \(w = f(z)\) or a parameter.""",
        // ---- Special functions
        "error function" to """\(\operatorname{erf}(0) = 0\), \(\operatorname{erf}(1) \approx 0.8427\); \(\int_0^x e^{-t^2}\,dt = \frac{\sqrt{\pi}}{2}\operatorname{erf}(x)\).""",
        "imaginary error function" to """\(\operatorname{erfi}(1) \approx 1.6505\); \(\int e^{x^2}\,dx = \frac{\sqrt{\pi}}{2}\operatorname{erfi}(x) + C\).""",
