        "Fresnel sine integral" to """\(S(1) \approx 0.4383\); integrals of \(\sin x^2\) come out in it. Graph \(S(x)\) against \(C(x)\) for the Euler spiral.""",
        "Fresnel cosine integral" to """\(C(1) \approx 0.7799\); both tend to \(\frac{1}{2}\).""",
        "incomplete elliptic integral of the first kind" to """Fill the angle φ and the parameter \(m\): \(F(\varphi \mid 0) = \varphi\); a pendulum's period uses \(F\left(\frac{\pi}{2} \mid m\right)\).""",
        // ---- Combinatorics
        "Stirling number of the first kind" to """Shown as \(s(\square, \square)\): fill \(n\) and \(k\). \(s(4, 2) = 11\). Long-press = for the definition.""",
        "Stirling number of the second kind" to """Shown as \(S(\square, \square)\): \(S(4, 2) = 7\), splitting 4 things into 2 groups.""",
        "Bell number" to """Shown as \(B(\square)\): \(B(5) = 52\). Graph \(y = B(x)\) to see it grow (as steps).""",
