        "Eulerian number" to """Shown as \(A(\square, \square)\): \(A(5, 2) = 66\); \(A(n, k) = \sum_{j=0}^{k} (-1)^j \binom{n+1}{j}(k + 1 - j)^n\).""",
        "rising factorial" to """Shown as \(x^{(n)}\): fill \(x\), then \(n\) in the raised box. \(2^{(3)} = 24\); with a letter, \(x^{(3)} = x^3 + 3x^2 + 2x\).""",
        "falling factorial" to """Shown as \((x)_n\): \((6)_3 = 120\), ordered choices of 3 from 6.""",
        "superfactorial" to """Shown as \(\operatorname{sf}(\square)\): \(\operatorname{sf}(5) = 34560\).""",
        "harmonic number" to """Shown as \(H_{\square}\): \(H_5 = \frac{137}{60}\). \(\sum_{n=1}^{4} H_n = \frac{77}{12}\). Graphs as a smooth curve.""",
        "triangular number" to """Shown as \(T_{\square}\): \(T_{10} = 55\).""",
        "Motzkin number" to """Shown as \(M_{\square}\): \(M_6 = 51\).""",
        "Pell number" to """Shown as \(P_{\square}\): \(P_6 = 70\); \(\frac{P_{n+1}}{P_n} \to 1 + \sqrt{2}\).""",
        "primorial" to """Shown as \(\square\#\): \(10\# = 2 \cdot 3 \cdot 5 \cdot 7 = 210\).""",
        // ---- Polynomials
        "Legendre polynomial" to """Shown as \(P_{\square}(\square)\): the degree in the small box, then the variable. \(P_2(x) = \frac{3x^2 - 1}{2}\); \(P_3\left(\frac{1}{2}\right) = -\frac{7}{16}\).""",
        "Hermite polynomial" to """Shown as \(H_{\square}(\square)\): \(H_2(x) = 4x^2 - 2\).""",
        "probabilists' Hermite polynomial" to """Shown as \(He_{\square}(\square)\): \(He_2(x) = x^2 - 1\).""",
